{"id":"n16080-5-7","stage":0,"title":"알아보다 · 认出","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16080-5-7-1","ko":"나 누군지 모르겠어?","zh":"你认不出我了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"누군지","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누군지","audio":"/audio/7d865cb2b461058a6a04.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어?","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어","audio":"/audio/b0a5887fc79197b11412.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a482afe2bc8002e6360d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16080-5-7-2","ko":"지수구나! 살이 많이 빠져서 못 알아봤어.","zh":"原来是智秀！你瘦了好多，我都没认出来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수구나!","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"지수구나","audio":"/audio/31eba2968935e65acdf8.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수구나","audio":"/audio/31eba2968935e65acdf8.mp3"}},{"text":"살이","meaning":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","explanation":"살 指人身上的肉；살이 찌다 是长胖，살이 빠지다 是变瘦，살을 빼다 是减重。这里不是梳子齿、年龄或皮肤义。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살이","audio":"/audio/10d950f9fb857268bb30.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"빠져서","meaning":"掉，减轻，变瘦","explanation":"빠지다：掉，减轻，变瘦；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66637","senseId":"10","lemma":"빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빠져서","audio":"/audio/28fd3a7f86bc3a18a83f.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"알아봤어.","meaning":"认出","explanation":"알아보다：认出；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알아보다","audio":"/audio/1d2b64ddd329540a6838.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16080","senseId":"5","lemma":"알아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아봤어","audio":"/audio/382e5836d653b89d3f7b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66883","definition":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"f1cb0821aeeaddd3","term":"빠지다","zh":"掉，减轻，变瘦","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3","entryId":"66637","definition":"肥肉或体重等减少。","pronunciation":["빠ː지다"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"1d2b64ddd329540a","term":"알아보다","zh":"认出","audio":"/audio/1d2b64ddd329540a6838.mp3","entryId":"16080","definition":"记着而不忘记。","pronunciation":["아라보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0d17eda7341d2773db05.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.62,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16080","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"5","sourceLevel":"초급","day":26,"sequenceScore":1.0707,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你认不出我了吗？","原来是智秀！你瘦了好多，我都没认出来。","你一般哪天会来这儿？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你认不出我了吗？","原来是智秀！你瘦了好多，我都没认出来。","你一般哪天会来这儿？"],"answer":1}]}
